This Daniels Agentic Framework (DAF) project has a Graphify knowledge graph at `graphify-out/` (domain graph from planning exit + code graph in developing).

**Canon loading policy:** `.agent/AGENTS.md` §2.1 — do not bulk-read PRD/GLOSSARY/ARCHITECTURE/README for orientation when `graphify-out/graph.json` exists.

- For codebase or architecture questions, first run `graphify query "<question>"` (or `graphify path "<A>" "<B>"` / `graphify explain "<concept>"`). These return a scoped subgraph, usually much smaller than `GRAPH_REPORT.md` or raw grep output.
- If `graphify-out/wiki/index.md` exists, navigate it instead of reading raw files.
- Read `graphify-out/GRAPH_REPORT.md` only for broad architecture review or when query/path/explain do not surface enough context.
- **After code changes:** `npm run kg:ingest` (or `graphify update .`).
- **After canonical `.agent/` doc changes (PRD, GLOSSARY, ARCHITECTURE):** `/daf-kg-ingest` (semantic merge + ingest).
